t</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-14719" class="mobile_menu menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-14719"><a target="_blank" href="https://edukan.edu/">EDUKAN</a></li><li id="menu-item-14647" class="mobile_menu menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-14647"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/login-resources/">Login</a><ul class="sub-menu"><li id="menu-item-14650" class="mobile_menu menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-14650"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/login-resources/">Login Resources</a></li><li id="menu-item-14649" class="mobile_menu menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-14649"><a href="https://m365.cloud.microsoft/chat/?auth=2">Student Login</a></li><li id="menu-item-14648" class="mobile_menu menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-14648"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/login/">Faculty Login</a></li><li id="menu-item-14702" class="mobile_menu menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-14702"><a href="https://forms.office.com/r/cv7vJC9aQS">IT Support</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-13779" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-13779"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/library-resources-and-links/">Library Resources and Links</a></li><li id="menu-item-14261" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-14261"><a target="_blank" href="https://wl.donorperfect.net/weblink/weblink.aspx?name=E333771&#038;id=7">Make a Donation</a></li><li id="menu-item-10376" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-10376"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/new-students/">New Students</a></li><li id="menu-item-10459" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-10459"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/news-media/">News &#038; Media</a><ul class="sub-menu"><li id="menu-item-10446" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-10446"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/news/">News</a></li><li id="menu-item-10443" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-10443"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/monthly-newsletter/">Monthly Newsletter</a></li><li id="menu-item-10452" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-10452"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/events/">Events</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-12790" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-12790"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/order-an-official-transcript/">Order a Transcript</a></li><li id="menu-item-15862" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-15862"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/class-schedule/">Class Schedule</a></li><li id="menu-item-12190" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-12190"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/student-services/">Student Services</a></li><li id="menu-item-17672" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-17672"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.focus2career.com/Portal/Login.cfm?SID=1924">FOCUS® 2</a></li></ul></nav>
