		</header><main id="main">
	<section id="hero" class="home has_BG has_video">
	<video src="https://prattcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Aug1_480_24_27.mp4" autoplay loop muted></video>	<div class="container">
		<div id="hero_copy">
			<h1>PRATT COMMUNITY COLLEGE</h1>		</div>
	</div>
</section>
<section id="" class="section altcol2 nomargin"><div class="sub_section sub_section_linkbar"><div class="container"><div class="linkbar"><p class="linkholder"><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/about-us/"><span>About Us</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/academics/"><span>Academics</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/academics/academic-calendars/"><span>Academic Calendars</span></a><a class="link" href=" https://prattcc.edu/apply/"><span>Admissions</span></a><a class="link" href="https://gobeaversports.com/landing/index/" target="_blank"><span>Athletics</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/monthly-newsletter/"><span>Beaver Buzz Newsletter</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/board-of-trustees/"><span>Board of Trustees</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/current-students/"><span>Current Students</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/human-resource-department/"><span>Employment</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/pcc-foundation/"><span>Foundation/Alumni</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/general-and-consumer-information/"><span>General and Consumer Information</span></a><a class="link" href=" https://wl.donorperfect.net/weblink/weblink.aspx?name=E333771&#038;id=7" target="_blank"><span>Make a Donation</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/new-students/"><span>New Students</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/student-services/" target="_blank"><span>Student Services</span></a><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/community-college-taxpayer-transparency-act/"><span>Taxpayer Public Information</span></a></p></div></div></div></section><section id="section_1" class="section altcol"><div class="sub_section sub_section_cta layout_center"><div class="container"><div class="cta"><h2><span class="highlight">Your Future Starts Now at <br> Pratt Community College</span></h2><p>Whether you are new to college, transferring from another college, military-affiliated student, or looking to learn something different later in life, Pratt Community College has something for you. PCC proudly welcomes everyone and we are committed to helping you build a community because ‘community’ is our middle name.</p><p class="buttonholder"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/our-college/"><span>Our College</span></a><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/our-campus/"><span>Our Campus</span></a></p></div></div></div></section><section id="section_2" class="section hasBG"><div class="sub_section sub_section_cta layout_right"><div class="container"><div class="cta"><h2>Degrees and Programs at <br/>Pratt Community College</h2><p class="buttonholder"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/academics/"><span>View All</span></a></p></div></div></div></section><section id="section_3" class="section"><div class="sub_section sub_section_boxes color_dark layout_block"><div class="container"><div class="boxwrapper"><div class="copyholder"><h2>About Pratt Community College </h2><p class="buttonholder"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/about-us/"><span>Learn More</span></a></p></div><div class="boxholder"><div class="boxes"><div class="box hasLink"><img width="1" height="1" src="https://prattcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Transfer.svg" class="box_icon" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /><h3 class="box_heading">Apply</h3><div class="box_copy"><p>Ready to take the next step toward your future? Applying to Pratt Community College is fast, free, and easy.</p></div><p class="box_link"><a class="button" href="http://selfservice.prattcc.edu/PowerCampusSelfService/Admissions/Applications" target="_blank"><span>Learn More</span></a></p></div><div class="box hasLink"><img width="1" height="1" src="https://prattcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Campus-Tour.svg" class="box_icon" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /><h3 class="box_heading">Campus Tours</h3><div class="box_copy"><p>Campus life at Pratt Community College is vibrant, welcoming, and full of opportunities to get involved. </p></div><p class="box_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/tour" target="_blank"><span>Learn More</span></a></p></div><div class="box hasLink"><img width="1" height="1" src="https://prattcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/International-Students.svg" class="box_icon" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /><h3 class="box_heading">Financial Aid </h3><div class="box_copy"><p> At Pratt Community College we realize that financial assistance is necessary for many students to receive an education. </p></div><p class="box_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/financial-aid-information-forms/" target="_blank"><span>Learn More</span></a></p></div><div class="box hasLink"><img width="1" height="1" src="https://prattcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/High-School.svg" class="box_icon" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /><h3 class="box_heading">High School College Start</h3><div class="box_copy"><p>With expert faculty, hands-on learning, and small, supportive classes, you’ll build academic confidence and stand out in future endeavors.</p></div><p class="box_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/high-school-college-start/"><span>Learn More</span></a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section_4" class="section altcol"><div class="sub_section sub_section_carousel"><div class="container"><h2 class="heading">Broaden Your Horizons at Pratt Community College!</h2><div class="carousel_wrap"><div id="carousel_4_0" class="carousel swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="carousel_slide swiper-slide"><div class="videoholder"><div style="width: 640px;" class="wp-video"><video class="wp-video-shortcode" id="video-2-1" width="640" height="390" preload="metadata" controls="controls"><source type="video/mp4" src="http://prattcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Tour-Video.mp4?_=1" /><a href="http://prattcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Tour-Video.mp4">http://prattcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Tour-Video.mp4</a></video></div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-nav"><div id="swiper-prev_4_0" class="swiper-button swiper-prev">&lsaquo;</div><div id="swiper-next_4_0" class="swiper-button swiper-next">&rsaquo;</div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section_5" class="section"><div class="sub_section sub_section_row"><div class="container"><div class="row d-tbl"><div id="row_img_5_0" class="imgholder d-tbl_cell" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="copyholder d-tbl_cell"><h2 class="heading">Cost and Financial Aid at <br>Pratt Community College </h2><p>The administration, faculty, and staff at Pratt Community College believe in quality education for everyone. We realize that financial assistance is necessary for many students to receive an education. Assistance is available to students through two primary sources of financial aid: gift aid (grants and scholarships) and self-help aid (student employment and federal direct student loans).</p><p class="buttonholder"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/cost-aid/"><span>Learn More</span></a></p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section_6" class="section altcol"><div class="sub_section sub_section_posts layout_boxes"><div class="container"><div class="section_viewall_heading"><h2>Featured Articles</h2></div><div class="posts"><div class="post"><div class="imgholder"><div id="post_img_6_0_0" class="img post_img"></div></div><div class="copyholder"><p class="post_date">November 3, 2026</p><h3 class="post_title"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/industry-partnerships-and-a-built-in-summer-internship-connect-classroom-learning-with-careers-in-the-energy-sector/">Industry partnerships and a built-in summer internship connect classroom learning with careers in the energy sector</a></h3><div class="post_excerpt">PRATT, Kan. — Pratt Community College continues to strengthen education-to-industry connections through its Electrical Powerline Technology (EPT) program, which prepares students for careers in the energy sector with hands-on training and real-world work experience. The College’s efforts reflect a broader commitment to listening to employers, building community partnerships, and preparing students for meaningful careers that [&hellip;]</div><p class="post_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/industry-partnerships-and-a-built-in-summer-internship-connect-classroom-learning-with-careers-in-the-energy-sector/"><span>Read More</span></a></p></div></div><div class="post"><div class="imgholder"><div id="post_img_6_0_1" class="img post_img"></div></div><div class="copyholder"><p class="post_date">October 21, 2026</p><h3 class="post_title"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/get-to-know-barton-nursing-open-house-comes-to-pratt-community-college-nov-9/">Get to Know Barton Nursing: Open House Comes to Pratt Community College Nov. 9</a></h3><div class="post_excerpt">Thinking about a career in nursing? Barton Community College&#8217;s nursing program is opening its doors in Pratt. The &#8220;Get to Know Barton Nursing!&#8221; Open House runs from 5 to 7 p.m. on Monday, Nov. 9, 2026, in Chandler Hall on the Pratt Community College campus. The event gives prospective students a close-up look at what [&hellip;]</div><p class="post_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/get-to-know-barton-nursing-open-house-comes-to-pratt-community-college-nov-9/"><span>Read More</span></a></p></div></div><div class="post"><div class="imgholder"><div id="post_img_6_0_2" class="img post_img"></div></div><div class="copyholder"><p class="post_date">June 30, 2026</p><h3 class="post_title"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/pratt-community-college-launches-see-art-differently-lecture-series/">Pratt Community College Launches &#8220;See Art Differently&#8221; Lecture Series</a></h3><div class="post_excerpt">Pratt Community College Launches &#8220;See Art Differently&#8221; Lecture Series Pratt Community College is inviting the community to explore the world of art through a brand-new, free public program: the Art Lecture Series. Running across three months — July, September, and February — the series will feature 10 lectures designed to help attendees see art differently, [&hellip;]</div><p class="post_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/pratt-community-college-launches-see-art-differently-lecture-series/"><span>Read More</span></a></p></div></div><div class="post"><div class="imgholder"><div id="post_img_6_0_3" class="img post_img"></div></div><div class="copyholder"><p class="post_date">September 11, 2026</p><h3 class="post_title"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/pratt-community-college-awarded-1-4-million-federal-grant-to-enhance-workforce-training-programs/">Pratt Community College Awarded $1.4 Million Federal Grant to Enhance Workforce Training Programs.</a></h3><div class="post_excerpt">Pratt Community College Awarded $1.4 Million Federal Grant to Enhance Workforce Training Programs. The funding will expand hands-on training and access to equipment in agriculture, commercial driver’s license, automotive technology, electrical powerline technology, and STEM. These sectors reflect key workforce demands in the Pratt region. Employers continue to seek skilled professionals to fill positions driven [&hellip;]</div><p class="post_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/pratt-community-college-awarded-1-4-million-federal-grant-to-enhance-workforce-training-programs/"><span>Read More</span></a></p></div></div><div class="post"><div class="imgholder"><div id="post_img_6_0_4" class="img post_img"></div></div><div class="copyholder"><p class="post_date">October 19, 2026</p><h3 class="post_title"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/pcc-wrestling-hog-roast-draws-302-supporters-for-a-day-of-gratitude/">PCC Wrestling Hog Roast Draws 302 Supporters for a Day of Gratitude</a></h3><div class="post_excerpt">PCC Wrestling Hog Roast Draws 302 Supporters for a Day of Gratitude The annual gathering brings together alums, fans, community members, youth wrestlers, and the future of Beaver Wrestling.   PRATT, Kan. (Oct. 19, 2026) — More than 300 people attended the Pratt Community College Wrestling Hog Roast on Saturday, Oct. 17. The night centered [&hellip;]</div><p class="post_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/pcc-wrestling-hog-roast-draws-302-supporters-for-a-day-of-gratitude/"><span>Read More</span></a></p></div></div><div class="post"><div class="imgholder"><div id="post_img_6_0_5" class="img post_img"></div></div><div class="copyholder"><p class="post_date">October 12, 2026</p><h3 class="post_title"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/pcc-hosts-presidents-meet-greet/">PCC Hosts President’s Meet &#038; Greet</a></h3><div class="post_excerpt">Faculty, Staff, and Community Members Gather to Welcome Incoming PCC President PRATT, Kan. — Pratt Community College was proud to host a President’s Meet &amp; Greet on October 1, bringing together members of the campus and greater Pratt community for an evening of connection and celebration in honor of PCC President Dr. Carl B. Smalls. [&hellip;]</div><p class="post_link"><a class="button" href="https://prattcc.edu/pcc-hosts-presidents-meet-greet/"><span>Read More</span></a></p></div></div></div><p class="viewall"><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/news/"><span>View All</span></a></p></div></div><div class="sub_section sub_section_events"><div class="container"><div class="section_viewall_heading"><h2>Calendar </h2></div><div class="events"><div class="event"><div class="event_tbl"><div class="event_datebox"><div class="event_datebox_inner"><span class="datemonth">4</span> December</div></div><div class="event_desc"><h3 class="event_name"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/events/christmas-to-remember/">Christmas to Remember</a></h3></div></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event_tbl"><div class="event_datebox"><div class="event_datebox_inner"><span class="datemonth">13</span> January</div></div><div class="event_desc"><h3 class="event_name"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/events/annie-auditions/">Annie Auditions!</a></h3></div></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event_tbl"><div class="event_datebox"><div class="event_datebox_inner"><span class="datemonth">1</span> February</div></div><div class="event_desc"><h3 class="event_name"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/events/pcc-art-lecture-series/">PCC Art Lecture Series</a></h3><div class="event_excerpt">Pratt Community College is bringing art to life! Join us for the Art Lecture Series, a free, community-wide series exploring 10 different topics in art history and appreciation — from the Elements of Art to Frida Kahlo. All sessions are held in Riney 312, 7:00–8:30 PM. Mark your calendars and come see art differently! This [&hellip;]</div></div></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event_tbl"><div class="event_datebox"><div class="event_datebox_inner"><span class="datemonth">14</span> February</div></div><div class="event_desc"><h3 class="event_name"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/events/encore-valentines-dinner-and-show/">Encore Valentine&#8217;s Dinner and Show</a></h3><div class="event_excerpt">RSVP to Misty Beck at mistyb@prattcc.edu. $30 per person</div></div></div></div><div class="event"><div class="event_tbl"><div class="event_datebox"><div class="event_datebox_inner"><span class="datemonth">2</span> April</div></div><div class="event_desc"><h3 class="event_name"><a href="https://prattcc.edu/events/annie/">Annie</a></h3></div></div></div></div><p class="viewall"><a class="link" href="https://prattcc.edu/events/"><span>View All</span></a></p></div></div></section></main>
		<footer id="footer">
			<div class="container">
				<div id="footer_cols" class="d-tbl">
					<div id="footer_left" class="d-tbl_cell">
